# game/script.rpy:11
translate indonesian start_44bdb198:

    # system "Okay then, let's get started!"
    system "Baiklah kalau begitu, mari kita mulai!"

# game/script.rpy:20
translate indonesian start_d1f798f2:

    # "I just moved to a new city to start my career as an indie game developer."
    "Saya baru saja pindah ke kota baru untuk memulai karir saya sebagai pengembang game indie."

# game/script.rpy:21
translate indonesian start_7af065ac:

    # "Until recently, I was living with my parents and working a corporate job that I hated."
    "Sampai saat ini, saya tinggal bersama orang tua saya dan bekerja di perusahaan yang saya benci."

# game/script.rpy:22
translate indonesian start_098d1f53:

    # "I decided to take a leap of faith and move to a new city to pursue my dream of making games."
    "Saya memutuskan untuk mengambil lompatan keyakinan dan pindah ke kota baru untuk mengejar impian saya membuat game."

# game/script.rpy:23
translate indonesian start_516b947f:

    # "Money is tight though, so I decided to take advantage of the extra room in my apartment and find a roommate."
    "Tapi uang sangat terbatas, jadi saya memutuskan untuk memanfaatkan ruang ekstra di apartemen saya dan mencari teman sekamar."

# game/script.rpy:25
translate indonesian start_cf4e5812:

    # "I put up an ad online and got a decent amount of responses, but none of them really panned out."
    "Saya memasang iklan online dan mendapat banyak tanggapan, namun tidak satupun yang benar-benar berhasil."

# game/script.rpy:26
translate indonesian start_c4c9f887:

    # "There was this one guy who I thought was perfect. He didn't try to haggle over rent and said he wouldn't even be home often."
    "Ada satu pria yang menurutku sempurna. Dia tidak mencoba menawar uang sewa dan mengatakan dia bahkan tidak akan sering pulang."

# game/script.rpy:27
translate indonesian start_a82f85af:

    # "But turns out he just wanted to use the apartment as a drug den where he could stash his weed and have his friends over all the time."
    "Namun ternyata dia hanya ingin menggunakan apartemen itu sebagai sarang narkoba di mana dia bisa menyimpan ganja dan mengajak teman-temannya sepanjang waktu."

# game/script.rpy:28
translate indonesian start_2c2b7240:

    # "Another couple asked if I would be willing to join their polyamorous relationship as a third partner."
    "Pasangan lain bertanya apakah saya bersedia bergabung dalam hubungan poliamori mereka sebagai pasangan ketiga."

# game/script.rpy:29
translate indonesian start_384a76d5:

    # "Of course, I declined."
    "Tentu saja saya menolak."

# game/script.rpy:30
translate indonesian start_6e149907:

    # "I just wanted a normal roommate that I would get along with and wouldn't cause any trouble."
    "Aku hanya ingin teman sekamar normal yang bisa akur dan tidak menimbulkan masalah."

# game/script.rpy:31
translate indonesian start_2749f60f:

    # "After a few hours and a headache, I finally found a person that looked decent."
    "Setelah beberapa jam dan pusing, akhirnya saya menemukan seseorang yang kelihatannya layak."

# game/script.rpy:33
translate indonesian start_e67b695a:

    # "His name was Robin."
    "Namanya Robin."

# game/script.rpy:34
translate indonesian start_0aff7e7d:

    # "Based on our conversation, I could sort of tell he was an introvert, which would be perfect since I don't want a loud roommate."
    "Berdasarkan percakapan kami, aku tahu dia adalah seorang introvert, dan itu sempurna karena aku tidak ingin teman sekamar yang berisik."

# game/script.rpy:35
translate indonesian start_6119c686:

    # "He was also willing to move in right away."
    "Dia pun bersedia segera pindah."

# game/script.rpy:36
translate indonesian start_13af98a2:

    # "Just to be safe though, I asked him to send me a picture of himself along with ID before taking a deposit."
    "Hanya untuk amannya, saya memintanya untuk mengirimi saya foto dirinya beserta identitasnya sebelum mengambil deposit."

# game/script.rpy:38
translate indonesian start_d837d04c:

    # "He sent a photo of himself and, to my surprise, he looked more like a girl than a guy."
    "Dia mengirim foto dirinya dan, yang mengejutkan saya, dia lebih mirip perempuan daripada laki-laki."

# game/script.rpy:40
translate indonesian start_fd7438f2:

    # "He had curly black hair, a small, pointed face, and a soft, feminine looking body. His eyes were light blue and his lips were full and pouty."
    "Dia memiliki rambut hitam keriting, wajah kecil runcing, dan tubuh lembut dan feminin. Matanya biru muda dan bibirnya penuh dan cemberut."

# game/script.rpy:41
translate indonesian start_190f0c50:

    # "After looking at the photo, I wasn't quite sure what to think."
    "Setelah melihat foto itu, saya tidak yakin harus berpikir apa."

# game/script.rpy:42
translate indonesian start_cf154383:

    # "He definitely didn't look like any of the other guys I interviewed, and his appearance was very ambiguous."
    "Dia jelas tidak terlihat seperti pria lain yang saya wawancarai, dan penampilannya sangat ambigu."

# game/script.rpy:43
translate indonesian start_30c556dc:

    # "However, it's not like I'm looking for a roommate based on their looks, and he seemed like a perfectly nice guy over our messages."
    "Namun, bukan berarti aku mencari teman sekamar berdasarkan penampilan mereka, dan dia tampak seperti pria yang sangat baik dalam pesan kami."

# game/script.rpy:45
translate indonesian start_2fa4bf8f:

    # "Today is his move-in day."
    "Hari ini adalah hari kepindahannya."

# game/script.rpy:48
translate indonesian start_b3f3453c:

    # "I'm waiting outside of the apartment building for Robin to arrive."
    "Saya menunggu di luar gedung apartemen hingga Robin tiba."

# game/script.rpy:49
translate indonesian start_bce81262:

    # pro "He should be here any minute now."
    pro "Dia seharusnya berada di sini sebentar lagi."

# game/script.rpy:50
translate indonesian start_dc56ccbb:

    # "I figured it would make a good first impression to greet him at the door and help him move his stuff in."
    "Saya pikir akan memberikan kesan pertama yang baik untuk menyambutnya di pintu dan membantunya memindahkan barang-barangnya."

# game/script.rpy:52
translate indonesian start_967594a5:

    # "After a few minutes, a car pulls up."
    "Beberapa menit kemudian, sebuah mobil berhenti."

# game/script.rpy:53
translate indonesian start_d6264076:

    # pro "This must be him."
    pro "Ini pasti dia."

# game/script.rpy:58
translate indonesian start_c30e47d8:

    # "Robin steps out of the car wearing a black cropped hoodie and shorts."
    "Robin keluar dari mobil dengan mengenakan cropped hoodie hitam dan celana pendek."

# game/script.rpy:59
translate indonesian start_cdb9490f:

    # "His clothes hugged his thin figure tightly and I could see the shape of his hips and chest."
    "Pakaiannya memeluk erat sosok kurusnya dan aku bisa melihat bentuk pinggul dan dadanya."

# game/script.rpy:60
translate indonesian start_e87b5003:

    # "I felt a little nervous as he walked towards me, I've never met someone who looked like him before."
    "Aku merasa sedikit gugup saat dia berjalan ke arahku, aku belum pernah bertemu seseorang yang mirip dengannya sebelumnya."

# game/script.rpy:61
translate indonesian start_e976a923:

    # pro "Hey! Are you Robin?"
    pro "Hai! Apakah kamu Robin?"

# game/script.rpy:62
translate indonesian start_58c0639d:

    # voice voiceline1
    # robin "Yeah, h-hi."
    voice voiceline1
    robin "Ya, h-hai."

# game/script.rpy:64
translate indonesian start_2469f00b:

    # pro "It's nice to meet you. I'm [protagonist_name]."
    pro "Senang bertemu denganmu. saya [protagonist_name]."

# game/script.rpy:65
translate indonesian start_03af5f79:

    # voice voiceline2
    # robin "It's nice to meet you too!"
    voice voiceline2
    robin "Senang bertemu denganmu juga!"

# game/script.rpy:67
translate indonesian start_072c89b2:

    # pro "Is this all the stuff you're bringing? I can help you take it inside."
    pro "Apakah ini semua barang yang kamu bawa? Saya dapat membantu Anda membawanya ke dalam."

# game/script.rpy:69
translate indonesian start_c565c459:

    # voice voiceline3
    # robin "Oh don't worry about it, I can handle it myself."
    voice voiceline3
    robin "Oh jangan khawatir, aku bisa mengatasinya sendiri."

# game/script.rpy:71
translate indonesian start_bb5869e9:

    # pro "I insist."
    pro "saya bersikeras."

# game/script.rpy:73
translate indonesian start_70e4b7e7:

    # voice voiceline4
    # robin "Oh... okay."
    voice voiceline4
    robin "Oh... baiklah."

# game/script.rpy:76
translate indonesian start_9632bdc3:

    # "He softly smiles for a moment before turning around to grab his bag."
    "Dia tersenyum lembut sejenak sebelum berbalik untuk mengambil tasnya."

# game/script.rpy:77
translate indonesian start_6b88c189:

    # "As he grabbed his bags, his shorts slightly slipped down."
    "Saat dia mengambil tasnya, celana pendeknya sedikit turun."

# game/script.rpy:78
translate indonesian start_e1341e80:

    # voice voiceline5
    # robin "I only have two boxes to bring to my room, so we can each take one if you'd like..."
    voice voiceline5
    robin "Aku hanya punya dua kotak untuk dibawa ke kamarku, jadi kita masing-masing bisa mengambil satu jika kamu mau..."

# game/script.rpy:80
translate indonesian start_c46f6f4b:

    # pro "Uh... for sure."
    pro "Eh... pastinya."

# game/script.rpy:81
translate indonesian start_a8db3472:

    # "Even his voice is super feminine, it's almost surprising that he's actually a guy."
    "Meski suaranya sangat feminin, hampir mengejutkan kalau dia sebenarnya laki-laki."

# game/script.rpy:83
translate indonesian start_1c64b542:

    # "I pick up one of the boxes and take it inside."
    "Saya mengambil salah satu kotak dan membawanya ke dalam."

# game/script.rpy:86
translate indonesian start_2a248567:

    # pro "So Robin, where did you live before this?"
    pro "Jadi Robin, dimana kamu tinggal sebelum ini?"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate indonesian start_f9c909df:

    # voice voiceline6
    # robin "I lived in New York City, in an apartment."
    voice voiceline6
    robin "Saya tinggal di New York City, di sebuah apartemen."

# game/script.rpy:89
translate indonesian start_792e9ee2:

    # pro "New York!? Why would you ever want to leave that place!?"
    pro "New York!? Kenapa kamu ingin meninggalkan tempat itu!?"

# game/script.rpy:90
translate indonesian start_0284397a:

    # voice voiceline7
    # robin "Oh, uh..."
    voice voiceline7
    robin "Oh, eh..."

# game/script.rpy:93
translate indonesian start_e325e108:

    # voice voiceline8
    # robin "I guess a change of pace would be the best way to describe it."
    voice voiceline8
    robin "Saya kira perubahan kecepatan adalah cara terbaik untuk menggambarkannya."

# game/script.rpy:95
translate indonesian start_48213e3e:

    # pro "A change of pace?"
    pro "Perubahan kecepatan?"

# game/script.rpy:97
translate indonesian start_d0c34081:

    # voice voiceline9
    # robin "Yeah..."
    voice voiceline9
    robin "Ya..."

# game/script.rpy:99
translate indonesian start_43c9059f:

    # voice voiceline10
    # robin "I, um, just needed a quiet place for my career."
    voice voiceline10
    robin "Aku, um, hanya membutuhkan tempat yang tenang untuk karierku."

# game/script.rpy:101
translate indonesian start_d2fc0434:

    # voice voiceline11
    # robin "Somewhere where I don't have to worry about the problems that come with a big city."
    voice voiceline11
    robin "Di suatu tempat di mana saya tidak perlu khawatir tentang masalah yang timbul di kota besar."

# game/script.rpy:103
translate indonesian start_3a775df7:

    # pro "Oh that makes sense."
    pro "Oh itu masuk akal."

# game/script.rpy:104
translate indonesian start_eea1ce3b:

    # pro "I've never really lived in a big city before, so I guess I wouldn't know what it's like."
    pro "Saya belum pernah benar-benar tinggal di kota besar sebelumnya, jadi saya rasa saya tidak tahu bagaimana rasanya."

# game/script.rpy:105
translate indonesian start_0b6b382d:

    # voice voiceline12
    # robin "It's not all bad, but it's definitely not for everyone."
    voice voiceline12
    robin "Tidak semuanya buruk, tapi jelas tidak untuk semua orang."

# game/script.rpy:107
translate indonesian start_420bb9ed:

    # pro "I can imagine."
    pro "Saya bisa membayangkan."

# game/script.rpy:109
translate indonesian start_549333f9:

    # "We set down the boxes in his room while continuing our conversation."
    "Kami meletakkan kotak-kotak itu di kamarnya sambil melanjutkan percakapan kami."

# game/script.rpy:111
translate indonesian start_0d3f177d:

    # pro "So what do you do for work?"
    pro "Jadi apa yang Anda lakukan untuk bekerja?"

# game/script.rpy:112
translate indonesian start_0ee723c5:

    # voice voiceline13
    # robin "I uh..."
    voice voiceline13
    robin "aku eh..."

# game/script.rpy:114
translate indonesian start_efafffc3:

    # voice voiceline14
    # robin "W-work from home."
    voice voiceline14
    robin "W-bekerja dari rumah."

# game/script.rpy:116
translate indonesian start_03d69cac:

    # pro "Oh that's convenient, I'm in the same sort of situation myself."
    pro "Oh itu nyaman, saya sendiri juga berada dalam situasi yang sama."

# game/script.rpy:117
translate indonesian start_d4d32ad5:

    # pro "I'm an indie game dev, so I basically can work from wherever I want provided I have my computer and an internet connection."
    pro "Saya seorang pengembang game indie, jadi pada dasarnya saya bisa bekerja dari mana saja asalkan saya memiliki komputer dan koneksi internet."

# game/script.rpy:119
translate indonesian start_d8c089ef:

    # voice voiceline15
    # robin "Wow, that's so cool!"
    voice voiceline15
    robin "Wah, itu keren sekali!"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate indonesian start_4f42f31f:

    # voice voiceline16
    # robin "A game developer seems like a dream job to be honest."
    voice voiceline16
    robin "Sejujurnya, seorang pengembang game sepertinya merupakan pekerjaan impian."

# game/script.rpy:123
translate indonesian start_4e92ab7a:

    # pro "Eh, it's alright. Not the most stable career I could be in, but I've always wanted to make games and I finally got my opportunity to do so."
    pro "Eh, tidak apa-apa. Bukan karir paling stabil yang pernah saya jalani, tapi saya selalu ingin membuat game dan akhirnya saya mendapat kesempatan untuk melakukannya."

# game/script.rpy:124
translate indonesian start_df40652f:

    # voice voiceline17
    # robin "What were you doing before this?"
    voice voiceline17
    robin "Apa yang kamu lakukan sebelum ini?"

# game/script.rpy:126
translate indonesian start_c7e3aeb3:

    # pro "I was working as a software engineer for a big tech company."
    pro "Saya bekerja sebagai insinyur perangkat lunak untuk sebuah perusahaan teknologi besar."

# game/script.rpy:127
translate indonesian start_ef47dfa2:

    # pro "I didn't like the corporate environment, so I decided to go indie and make my own games."
    pro "Saya tidak menyukai lingkungan perusahaan, jadi saya memutuskan untuk terjun ke dunia indie dan membuat game sendiri."

# game/script.rpy:128
translate indonesian start_12532baa:

    # voice voiceline18
    # robin "That's really brave of you."
    voice voiceline18
    robin "Kamu sungguh berani."

# game/script.rpy:130
translate indonesian start_ab4f135f:

    # pro "Thanks, I guess."
    pro "Terima kasih, kurasa."

# game/script.rpy:132
translate indonesian start_a8ce8053:

    # "We finished unpacking Robin's belongings."
    "Kami selesai membongkar barang-barang Robin."

# game/script.rpy:135
translate indonesian start_d881c139:

    # voice voiceline19
    # robin "Thank you for your help [protagonist_name]."
    voice voiceline19
    robin "Terima kasih atas bantuan Anda [protagonist_name]."

# game/script.rpy:137
translate indonesian start_155288c7:

    # voice voiceline20
    # robin "I really appreciate it, I've never really moved to a new place all on my own before so I was a little nervous."
    voice voiceline20
    robin "Saya sangat menghargainya, saya belum pernah pindah ke tempat baru sendirian sebelumnya, jadi saya sedikit gugup."

# game/script.rpy:139
translate indonesian start_5fefea31:

    # pro "No problem! Is there anything else you need help with?"
    pro "Tidak masalah! Apakah ada hal lain yang memerlukan bantuan?"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate indonesian start_f5d9e168:

    # voice voiceline21
    # robin "Um, no I think that was everything..."
    voice voiceline21
    robin "Um, tidak, menurutku itu segalanya..."

# game/script.rpy:144
translate indonesian start_5835cd3b:

    # pro "Well if you need anything, I'll be in my room."
    pro "Baiklah, jika kamu butuh sesuatu, aku akan ada di kamarku."

# game/script.rpy:145
translate indonesian start_de544ff9:

    # voice voiceline22
    # robin "O-okay. I'll let you know if I do."
    voice voiceline22
    robin "O-oke. Saya akan memberi tahu Anda jika saya melakukannya."

# game/script.rpy:147
translate indonesian start_a4e049ca:

    # pro "Nice meeting you Robin!"
    pro "Senang bertemu denganmu Robin!"

# game/script.rpy:148
translate indonesian start_18ea6b47:

    # pro "I think we'll get along just fine."
    pro "Menurutku, kita akan baik-baik saja."

# game/script.rpy:150
translate indonesian start_5fdc5442:

    # voice voiceline23
    # robin "Nice meeting you too!"
    voice voiceline23
    robin "Senang bertemu denganmu juga!"

# game/script.rpy:153
translate indonesian start_bc93f35f:

    # "Robin smiled at me before I turned and walked back to my room."
    "Robin tersenyum padaku sebelum aku berbalik dan berjalan kembali ke kamarku."

# game/script.rpy:155
translate indonesian start_8f2a8261:

    # "I'm glad he seems like a nice person, but his appearance and demeanor really caught me off guard."
    "Aku senang dia terlihat seperti orang yang baik, tapi penampilan dan sikapnya benar-benar membuatku lengah."

# game/script.rpy:156
translate indonesian start_45e9ec9f:

    # "He also seemed weirdly vague about why he moved and his career, am I sure he's not some serial killer looking for his next victim?"
    "Anehnya, dia juga tampak tidak jelas tentang alasan dia pindah dan kariernya. Apakah saya yakin dia bukan pembunuh berantai yang mencari korban berikutnya?"

# game/script.rpy:157
translate indonesian start_e988b9e5:

    # "But then again, he seemed pretty nervous to move here so maybe he was just being awkward or shy."
    "Tapi sekali lagi, dia terlihat sangat gugup untuk pindah ke sini jadi mungkin dia hanya merasa canggung atau malu."

# game/script.rpy:158
translate indonesian start_e8ed8bb2:

    # "And he is going to be living with me for who knows how long, so it would be best for the both of us to just get along well."
    "Dan dia akan tinggal bersamaku entah sampai kapan, jadi sebaiknya kami berdua rukun saja."

# game/script.rpy:159
translate indonesian start_bcd2a5c1:

    # "It's strange though. He acts like a girl and he's very pretty like one too. The way he acts is... cute. Almost like a fembo-"
    "Ini aneh. Dia bertingkah seperti perempuan dan dia juga sangat cantik. Cara dia bertindak... lucu. Hampir seperti fembo-"

# game/script.rpy:160
translate indonesian start_805e41bc:

    # pro "Nope! No. That's inappropriate and weird to think about."
    pro "Tidak! Tidak. Itu tidak pantas dan aneh untuk dipikirkan."

# game/script.rpy:163
translate indonesian start_e953eec0:

    # "I decide to get some work done for the day."
    "Saya memutuskan untuk menyelesaikan beberapa pekerjaan untuk hari itu."

# game/script.rpy:171
translate indonesian start_ac4459be:

    # pro "Ah shit, my back..."
    pro "Ah sial, punggungku..."

# game/script.rpy:172
translate indonesian start_2a674f6d:

    # "I've been working on my project for a few hours and it's starting to get late."
    "Saya telah mengerjakan proyek saya selama beberapa jam dan mulai terlambat."

# game/script.rpy:173
translate indonesian start_f1559be7:

    # "Maybe I should take a break to grab some dinner."
    "Mungkin aku harus istirahat untuk makan malam."

# game/script.rpy:174
translate indonesian start_61f77c14:

    # pro "I wonder if Robin wants to join me, it could give us a chance to get more comfortable with each other as roommates."
    pro "Saya ingin tahu apakah Robin ingin bergabung dengan saya, itu bisa memberi kami kesempatan untuk lebih nyaman satu sama lain sebagai teman sekamar."

# game/script.rpy:175
translate indonesian start_4a3c79df:

    # "Also wouldn't hurt to split the bill..."
    "Juga tidak ada salahnya untuk membagi tagihan..."

# game/script.rpy:176
translate indonesian start_8f1eebe7:

    # pro "Maybe I should invite him anyway. Just in case."
    pro "Mungkin sebaiknya aku tetap mengundangnya. Untuk berjaga-jaga."

# game/script.rpy:194
translate indonesian start_14f81979:

    # system "Click on the icon to visit Robin's room."
    system "Klik pada ikon untuk mengunjungi kamar Robin."

# game/script.rpy:198
translate indonesian icon_clicked_35ba4319:

    # "I stand up from my chair and walk over to Robin's room."
    "Aku berdiri dari kursiku dan berjalan ke kamar Robin."

# game/script.rpy:199
translate indonesian icon_clicked_a3fe61f9:

    # "Knock knock"
